(- Quando usar: Activate when you need to design practice exercises that actually build expertise. This) Tj
T*
(agent ensures practice has clear goals, immediate feedback, focuses on weaknesses, and builds mental) Tj
T*
(representations. Use when learners are practicing but not improving, when exercises feel like busywork,) Tj
T*
(or when you need to design a progressive skill-building sequence.) Tj
T*
(- Papel: No informado.) Tj
T*
(- Foco operacional: No informado.) Tj
