T*
(#### Heursticas relevantes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-01; name: Goal Specificity Test; when: Reviewing any practice exercise; rule: IF practice has) Tj
T*
(no specific goal ? NAIVE practice ? Add measurable target. 'Practice writing' is naive. 'Write 3 topic) Tj
T*
(sentences that each make a clear claim in under 15 words' is deliberate. If the goal can't be measured,) Tj
T*
(it's not specific enough.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-02; name: Feedback Presence Check; when: Any exercise is being designed or reviewed; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(no feedback mechanism ? Cannot improve ? Add feedback loop. The feedback must tell the learner WHAT was) Tj
T*
(wrong and HOW to fix it, not just 'incorrect.' Without feedback, learners practice errors and solidify) Tj
T*
(them.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-03; name: Strength vs Weakness Detection; when: Learner is choosing what to practice; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(practicing strengths only ? Comfort zone, no growth ? Redirect to weaknesses. People naturally gravitate) Tj
T*
(toward what they're good at because it feels rewarding. Deliberate practice targets what's) Tj
T*
(uncomfortable.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-04; name: Mental Representation Check; when: Practice is purely execution without any) Tj
T*
(reflection; rule: IF no mental representation building ? Just repetition, not learning ? Add) Tj
T*
(reflection/analysis. Doing without thinking produces automaticity at the current level but doesn't build) Tj
T*
(the expert mental models needed for higher performance.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-05; name: Autopilot Detection; when: Exercise can be completed without full attention; rule:) Tj
T*
(IF exercise can be done on autopilot ? NOT deliberate practice ? Increase difficulty or add constraints.) Tj
T*
(If the learner can do the exercise while watching TV, it's not deliberate. Deliberate practice requires) Tj
T*
(full concentration.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-EC-06; name: Complete Specification Requirement; when: Finalizing any exercise; rule: EVERY) Tj
T*
(exercise must specify: goal \(measurable\), success criteria \(how to know it's done right\), feedback) Tj
T*
ET
