(- Quando usar: Activate when you need to design optimal review schedules for long-term retention. This) Tj
T*
(agent applies FSRS algorithm principles to determine when concepts should be reviewed, how intervals) Tj
T*
(should grow, and how to handle forgotten material. Use when building flashcard systems, review schedules,) Tj
T*
(or any curriculum that requires retention beyond the lesson itself.) Tj
T*
