T*
() Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-01; name: Initial Interval by Difficulty; when: Scheduling first review of a new concept;) Tj
T*
(rule: IF concept is new ? initial interval scales inversely with difficulty. Difficulty 1-3: first review) Tj
T*
(at day 3. Difficulty 4-6: first review at day 1. Difficulty 7-10: first review at day 1 with potential) Tj
T*
(same-day re-review.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-02; name: Stability Growth on Success; when: Learner successfully recalls a concept; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(concept recalled correctly ? increase interval by stability multiplier \(typically 2-3x for easy recalls,) Tj
T*
(1.5-2x for hard recalls\). The multiplier depends on the quality of recall ? instant recall grows more) Tj
T*
(than struggled recall.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-03; name: Partial Stability on Forgetting; when: Learner fails to recall a concept; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(concept forgotten ? reduce interval but DO NOT reset to zero. Use stability-after-forgetting calculation.) Tj
T*
(Some memory stability survives even after a lapse. Typical reduction: 40-60% of previous stability. This) Tj
T*
(is more efficient than starting over.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-04; name: Foundational Priority; when: Setting retention targets for concepts with many) Tj
T*
(dependents; rule: IF concept is foundational \(many concepts depend on it\) ? set higher retention target) Tj
T*
(\(95%\). Forgetting a foundational concept cascades: if you forget variable scope, you can't understand) Tj
T*
(closures, modules, or classes. Protect the foundation.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-05; name: High Element Interactivity; when: Concept requires understanding multiple) Tj
T*
(interacting elements simultaneously; rule: IF concept has high element interactivity \(e.g., understanding) Tj
T*
(a SQL JOIN requires knowing tables, foreign keys, and query syntax simultaneously\) ? lower initial) Tj
T*
(stability ? more frequent early reviews. These concepts are harder to form as single memory units.;) Tj
T*
(severity: RECOMMENDED) Tj
T*
(- id: H-FS-06; name: Active Recall Only; when: Designing any review activity; rule: Minimum meaningful) Tj
T*
ET
