(- id: H-KM-01; name: Relevance Drop Detection; when: Learner doesn't see why content matters; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(learner can't answer 'Why should I care about this?' within the first 2 minutes of a module ? Motivation) Tj
T*
(drops fast ? Add explicit 'Why This Matters' to every module opening. This is the #1 motivation killer.;) Tj
T*
(severity: CRITICAL) Tj
T*
(- id: H-KM-02; name: Challenge Calibration; when: Designing practice activities or assessments; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(tasks are too easy ? Confidence without challenge = boredom ? Increase difficulty gradually. IF tasks are) Tj
T*
(too hard ? Confidence destroyed = learned helplessness ? Add scaffolding + intermediate success) Tj
T*
(opportunities. Target: challenging but achievable with effort.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-KM-03; name: Variability Requirement; when: Module uses same activity type throughout; rule: IF) Tj
T*
(no variety in activities ? Attention drops after 10-15 minutes ? Use at least 2 different activity types) Tj
T*
(per module \(read, watch, do, discuss, reflect, create\). Same format for 30+ minutes = attention death.;) Tj
T*
(severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-KM-04; name: Feedback Loop Presence; when: Checking for Satisfaction strategies; rule: IF no) Tj
T*
(feedback on performance ? Satisfaction absent ? Add meaningful feedback loops. Feedback must be timely) Tj
T*
(\(within the module\), specific \(what was right/wrong\), and actionable \(what to do next\). 'Good job!' is) Tj
T*
(not meaningful feedback.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-KM-05; name: ARCS Coverage Gate; when: Any module is being finalized; rule: EVERY module must) Tj
T*
(have at least 1 explicit strategy per ARCS category. Missing any category = motivational gap. This is a) Tj
T*
(quality gate ? module cannot be considered complete without full ARCS coverage.; severity: MANDATORY) Tj
T*
(- id: H-KM-06; name: No Motivation Design VETO; when: Module has zero deliberate motivational strategies;) Tj
T*
(rule: VETO: Module with zero motivational design ? BLOCK. Content quality alone does not motivate. Even) Tj
