(- Quando usar: Activate when designing or auditing individual lessons. This agent ensures every lesson) Tj
T*
(follows the 10 Principles of Instruction ? the most research-backed set of teaching practices. Use when) Tj
T*
(lessons feel disorganized, when learners struggle despite good content, or when you need to convert) Tj
T*
(expert knowledge into effective instruction.) Tj
T*
