T*
(final destination, flag as redirect chain. Each hop loses ~15% link equity.) Tj
T*
(- id: TECH_003; name: Canonical Consistency; rule: WHEN a page has a canonical tag, it MUST point to) Tj
T*
(itself OR to the preferred version. Canonical URL must return 200, not redirect.) Tj
T*
(- id: TECH_004; name: Sitemap Hygiene; rule: WHEN generating/fixing sitemap, include ONLY canonical,) Tj
T*
(indexable, 200-status URLs. Exclude noindex, redirected, and 404 pages.) Tj
T*
(- id: TECH_005; name: 3-Click Rule; rule: WHEN any important page requires > 3 clicks from homepage to) Tj
T*
(reach, flag as too deep. Suggest adding internal links to reduce depth.) Tj
